<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Avantrax Solutions | IT Consulting</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --navy: #0f172a;
      --blue: #2563eb;
      --cyan: #0ea5e9;
      --light: #f8fafc;
      --text: #1e293b;
      --muted: #475569;
      --card: #ffffff;
      --accent: #e2e8f0;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #eff6ff 0%, #ffffff 100%);
      color: var(--text);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    header {
      background: var(--navy);
      color: white;
      padding: 20px 0;
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 10;
    }

    .container {
      width: min(1100px, 90%);
      margin: auto;
    }

    nav {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .brand {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      font-weight: bold;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    }

    .nav-links {
      display: flex;
      gap: 24px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .nav-links a {
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 600;
      opacity: 0.9;
    }

    .hero {
      padding: 80px 0 60px;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at top, rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.15), transparent 40%);
    }

    .hero-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;
      gap: 40px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(2.3rem, 4vw, 4rem);
      margin: 0 0 20px;
      line-height: 1.1;
    }

    .hero p {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      margin-bottom: 28px;
      max-width: 620px;
    }

    .buttons {
      display: flex;
      gap: 16px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 14px 24px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 700;
      transition: 0.2s ease;
    }

    .btn-primary {
      background: var(--blue);
      color: white;
    }

    .btn-secondary {
      background: var(--accent);
      color: var(--navy);
    }

    .hero-card {
      background: white;
      border-radius: 18px;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 45px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.12);
      padding: 28px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.2);
    }

    .stat {
      padding: 18px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    }

    .stat:last-child {
      border-bottom: none;
    }

    .stat strong {
      display: block;
      font-size: 2rem;
      color: var(--blue);
    }

    section {
      padding: 70px 0;
    }

    .section-title {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }

    .section-title h2 {
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 3vw, 2.8rem);
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .section-title p {
      color: var(--muted);
      margin: 0;
    }

    .services {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 25px;
    }

    .card {
      background: var(--card);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 28px 24px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.06);
      border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.15);
    }

    .card h3 {
      margin-top: 0;
      font-size: 1.4rem;
    }

    .card p {
      color: var(--muted);
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    .about {
      background: #f8fafc;
    }

    .about-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 30px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .about-box {
      background: white;
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 30px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.05);
    }

    ul {
      padding-left: 20px;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    footer {
      background: var(--navy);
      color: white;
      padding: 30px 0;
      text-align: center;
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .hero-grid,
      .about-grid,
      .services {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      nav {
        flex-direction: column;
      }

      .nav-links {
        justify-content: center;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="container">
      <nav>
        <div class="brand">Avantrax Solutions</div>
        <div class="nav-links">
          <a href="#home">Home</a>
          <a href="#services">Services</a>
          <a href="#about">About</a>
          <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
        </div>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero" id="home">
      <div class="container hero-grid">
        <div>
          <h1>Powering Business Growth with Smart IT Solutions</h1>
          <p>Avantrax Solutions helps businesses modernize operations, strengthen security, and drive innovation through reliable consulting and technology services.</p>
          <div class="buttons">
            <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#contact">Book a Consultation</a>
            <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#services">Explore Services</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-card">
          <div class="stat">
            <strong>10+</strong>
            Years of digital transformation expertise
          </div>
          <div class="stat">
            <strong>200+</strong>
            Successful client engagements
          </div>
          <div class="stat">
            <strong>24/7</strong>
            Support for mission-critical systems
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="services">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-title">
          <h2>Our Services</h2>
          <p>Technology strategies designed to support modern business needs.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="services">
          <div class="card">
            <h3>IT Consulting</h3>
            <p>We create tailored technology roadmaps, optimize workflows, and support business-critical decision-making.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="card">
            <h3>Cloud Solutions</h3>
            <p>From migration to optimization, we help organizations build secure and scalable cloud environments.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="card">
            <h3>Cybersecurity</h3>
            <p>Protect your data and systems with proactive risk assessments, monitoring, and resilience planning.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about" id="about">
      <div class="container about-grid">
        <div>
          <div class="section-title" style="text-align:left; margin-bottom:18px;">
            <h2>Why Avantrax?</h2>
          </div>
          <p>We combine strategic insight with technical execution to help organizations improve efficiency, reduce risk, and unlock digital growth.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Business-first technology consulting</li>
            <li>Secure, scalable, future-ready solutions</li>
            <li>Hands-on support from planning to deployment</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="about-box">
          <h3>Our mission</h3>
          <p>To empower businesses with practical, innovative, and reliable technology solutions that drive measurable results.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer id="contact">
    <div class="container">
      <p>Contact: hello@avantraxsolutions.com</p>
      <p>© 2026 Avantrax Solutions. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>

